-### Sensitivity-Aware Vector Clustering
-Groups similar attribute vectors into a codebook. Choose when spatial redundancy is high and transmission bandwidth is limited. [Sensitivity-Aware Vector Clustering](12167-sensitivity-aware-vector-clustering.md)
