-### Compact 3D Gaussian Representation (C3DGS)
-Uses structural pruning and masking. Choose when model size needs to be reduced by removing non-essential Gaussians. [Compact 3D Gaussian Representation (C3DGS)](12927-compact-3d-gaussian-representation-c3dgs.md)
